WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:03.302
-Performing "You're Not Here"
from her new album

00:00:03.302 --> 00:00:05.037
"Chapter One, Verse One,"

00:00:05.037 --> 00:00:09.742
here's Emmy, Grammy and Tony
Award winner Cynthia Erivo!

00:00:09.742 --> 00:00:14.213
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.213 --> 00:00:22.455 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:22.455 --> 00:00:28.594
♪ -I wish you knew
the person I am ♪

00:00:28.594 --> 00:00:35.101
♪ The way I hold my heart
in my hands ♪

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:41.540
♪ The way I sing like it's
the air that I breathe ♪

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:45.045
♪ People say it's everything ♪

00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:51.217
♪ I whistle still ♪

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:54.753
♪ Crack my knuckles too ♪

00:00:54.753 --> 00:00:57.824
♪ 'Cause these are
the two things you ♪

00:00:57.824 --> 00:01:01.227
♪ You taught me to do ♪

00:01:01.227 --> 00:01:04.030
♪ They get on
my mother's nerves ♪

00:01:04.030 --> 00:01:06.432
♪ Maybe 'cause I learned it
from you ♪

00:01:06.432 --> 00:01:12.272
♪ I hope one day there's more
for me to choose ♪

00:01:12.272 --> 00:01:18.744
♪ Until that day I wish this
to be true ♪

00:01:18.744 --> 00:01:22.215
♪ When I run ♪

00:01:22.215 --> 00:01:25.284
♪ I'm running to your arms ♪

00:01:25.284 --> 00:01:31.724
♪ And when I sing,
I'm singing to your heart ♪

00:01:31.724 --> 00:01:35.194
♪ I feel you near ♪

00:01:35.194 --> 00:01:38.097
♪ In my moment of fear ♪

00:01:38.097 --> 00:01:40.833
♪ But when I open up my eyes ♪

00:01:40.833 --> 00:01:44.203
♪ I see it clear ♪

00:01:44.203 --> 00:01:50.409
♪ It was only in my dreams
that you are here ♪

00:01:50.409 --> 00:01:52.879
♪ You're not here ♪

00:01:52.879 --> 00:01:59.852 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:59.852 --> 00:02:05.592
♪ Did you know I dropped
out of school? ♪

00:02:05.592 --> 00:02:09.161
♪ Nineteen years old ♪

00:02:09.161 --> 00:02:12.265
♪ With a whole lot to prove ♪

00:02:12.265 --> 00:02:15.968
♪ Carried on through my doubts ♪

00:02:15.968 --> 00:02:22.208
♪ All to figure out
who I was meant to be ♪

00:02:22.208 --> 00:02:25.811
♪ Mmm, mmm-mmm ♪

00:02:25.811 --> 00:02:32.018
♪ Ten years later,
29 years old ♪

00:02:32.018 --> 00:02:35.221
♪ Got my poor heart broken ♪

00:02:35.221 --> 00:02:38.124
♪ Did it over the phone ♪

00:02:38.124 --> 00:02:41.827
♪ Was in a hotel room ♪

00:02:41.827 --> 00:02:45.497
♪ And I was all alone ♪

00:02:45.497 --> 00:02:49.101
♪ I was alone ♪

00:02:49.101 --> 00:02:53.272
♪ I wanted to run ♪

00:02:53.272 --> 00:02:59.212
♪ Run into your arms and cry ♪

00:02:59.212 --> 00:03:02.415
♪ As you held me to your heart ♪

00:03:02.415 --> 00:03:08.755
♪ Feel you near
in my moment of fear ♪

00:03:08.755 --> 00:03:15.461
♪ But when I opened up my eyes
and wiped the tears ♪

00:03:15.461 --> 00:03:22.068
♪ It was only in my dreams
that you were here ♪

00:03:22.068 --> 00:03:27.907
♪ And now you're missing out on
how I get to live the life ♪

00:03:27.907 --> 00:03:34.446
♪ That I forever and a day
had dreamed all about ♪

00:03:34.446 --> 00:03:38.017
♪ And it's a shame
you won't be there ♪

00:03:38.017 --> 00:03:40.953
♪ For the joy
I've yet to share ♪

00:03:40.953 --> 00:03:44.090
♪ Because in spite of you,
I'm here ♪

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:47.460
♪ Oh, yes, I'm here ♪

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:50.830
♪ And I'm in love
and it's for real ♪

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:54.199
♪ And you'll never get
to meet them ♪

00:03:54.199 --> 00:04:00.406
♪ But I truly hope you're happy
where you are ♪

00:04:00.406 --> 00:04:06.946
♪ It's unfortunate we end
before we start ♪

00:04:06.946 --> 00:04:13.185
♪ I hope you know I'll always
love you from afar ♪

00:04:13.185 --> 00:04:18.290
♪ But I can't ignore the part ♪

00:04:18.290 --> 00:04:21.994
♪ 'Cause you'll never be here ♪

00:04:21.994 --> 00:04:26.565 line:0%
♪♪

00:04:26.565 --> 00:04:32.505
♪ Never be here ♪

00:04:36.042 --> 00:04:38.077
[ Cheers and applause ]

